{
  "answer": "You can override dependencies during FastAPI tests by using the `TestClient` with the `override_with` parameter. This allows you to pass a mock object to replace the dependency being tested. \n\nFor example:\n```python\nfrom fastapi.testclient import TestClient\nfrom yourapp.main import app\n\nclient = TestClient(app)\n\n# Override the dependency\nmock_dependency = MockDependency()\nclient = TestClient(app, override_with=mock_dependency)\n```",
